post-it: Computer's colours have changed
symptoms:
	Colours look wrong
		shows: the windows, menus and taskbar show in other colours
checks:
	Colour scheme is the usual one
		shows: Display Properties, Appearance, shows High Contrast Black
software steps:
	Right-click the desktop and pick Properties
	Open the Appearance tab
	Switch the Scheme back to Windows Standard
	Click Apply or OK
